    <statement><p>Find a vector equation with parameter <m>t</m> for the line of intersection of the planes <m>x+y+z=9</m> and <m>x+z=0.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>\mathbf{r}(t) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;-1,9,1\right&gt;+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;1,0,-1\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
